ets in somebody else can you may  actually give up the number one spot if  somebody else is able to take in assets  you're not and you basically are caught  in this uh you know this discount so i  think that for them and for the investor  it's better when it gets converted  they've been very open with it look they  had their lawyers actually published a  thing saying hey you know there may be  legal action here for us to force the  regulator's hands etc etc uh i think  it's just  it's a weird situation for everyone uh  and until it gets converted to a spot  etf i think that we're just gonna  continue to see this if you go and you  buy gbtc today basically what you're  doing is you're buying uh 73 or so of  bitcoin or you're buying a hundred  dollars for bitcoin for 73 dollars the  question is just in the future if you go  to sell it will it be worth the hundred  dollars of bitcoin that you actually  bought will it be worth 73 or will it be  worth less right nobody knows where it's  gonna end up being but i think part of  what is so tempting about it is that uh  you're basically buying a hundred  dollars worth of bitcoin for 73 dollars  right so it is a discount uh and the  idea is that if you have a really really  long time horizon uh ultimately the  question comes down do i think that  they're going to be able to convert this  to the spot etf if so then it's  interesting if you don't think that's  gonna happen then you should stay away  from it now the other piece of the  analysis that people forget is you're  not just making a bet on only the  conversion because there's still price  exposure to bitcoin so if bitcoin goes  down in price that will affect gbtc if  bitcoin goes up in price that'll be a  tailwind for gbtc as well so there's the  discount plus the price exposure to  bitcoin so i think ultimately people who  are buying this right now in the most  basic sense they're making two things  that they say okay i believe i believe  that bitcoin will be a good bet over  some period of time that is my  investment horizon and i believe that  bitcoin uh the grayscale bitcoin trust  will either not have a bigger discount  or it will end up actually going back to  nav or close to nav right so like the  discount will actually become less or  eventually return back to nav so if you  believe bitcoin's a good bet and you  believe that uh it's gonna happen then  people would end up buying

